   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Agent Run\n\nA brand-neutral AI agent run that thinks, calls tools against a real-seconds timer and streams a markdown answer in bursts.\n\nCategory: ai. Length: 10.433 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A product demo needs the beat after the prompt, where an AI agent plans, calls tools and lands on a specific answer.\n- The AI feature is your own, so the interface must stay brand-neutral with one accent color.\n- The reply is a short markdown answer with a heading, bullets, a small code block or citations that must read clearly on the final frame.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The scene is a prompt being typed into a recognizable branded chat product: write it yourself with chat-flow.\n- The agent is a coding CLI in a terminal: use terminal-simulator.\n- A single line should type itself out with no interface around it: use typewriter.\n\nVariables:\n- run (string): Run script, default \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Checkout conversion drop\\\", \\\"prompt\\\": \\\"Why did checkout conversion drop last week?\\\", \\\"plan\\\": [\\\"Compare the checkout funnel with the week before\\\", \\\"Break the drop down by browser and step\\\", \\\"Check what shipped and what the error logs say\\\"], \\\"steps\\\": [{\\\"icon\\\": \\\"chart\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Query analytics\\\", \\\"detail\\\": \\\"checkout funnel, last 7 days vs prior 7\\\", \\\"duration\\\": 1.4}, {\\\"icon\\\": \\\"database\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Run SQL\\\", \\\"detail\\\": \\\"conversion by browser and step\\\", \\\"duration\\\": 2.3}, {\\\"icon\\\": \\\"search\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Search logs\\\", \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Wallet payment errors on Safari\\\", \\\"duration\\\": 1.1}, {\\\"icon\\\": \\\"book\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Read 12 sources\\\", \\\"duration\\\": 3.2, \\\"sources\\\": [\\\"Checkout funnel\\\", \\\"Browser report\\\", \\\"Release 4.12\\\", \\\"PR #2186\\\", \\\"webkit.org\\\", \\\"developer.mozilla.org\\\", \\\"Payments runbook\\\", \\\"Error log\\\", \\\"Incident notes\\\", \\\"Wallet payments guide\\\", \\\"Support tickets\\\", \\\"Status page\\\"]}], \\\"answer\\\": \\\"## Wallet payments broke on Safari in release 4.12\\\\n\\\\nCheckout conversion fell from 3.4% to 2.7% last week, a 21% drop [1]. All of it comes from the payment step on Safari, 41% of checkouts [2].\\\\n\\\\n- Safari conversion halved, from 3.5% to 1.8%\\\\n- Desktop and tablet held steady at 3.3%\\\\n- 4.12 moved the card form into an iframe without `allow=\\\\\\\"payment\\\\\\\"` [3]\\\\n\\\\n```tsx\\\\n<iframe\\\\n  src={cardFormUrl}\\\\n  allow=\\\\\\\"payment\\\\\\\"\\\\n/>\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n**Fix:** add the attribute and ship 4.12.1 today.\\\"}\"\n- theme (enum): Theme, default \"light\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#2563eb\"\n- compression (number, 1-8): Compression, default 3\n- seed (number, 1-99): Seed, default 1\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
